I wish to extend my sincere thanks for  the invitation to participate in today's  important international conference which  significant subject touches on the  willful destruction in some areas of the  world of the humanities cultural  heritage the horrible Dario franceschi  knee Italy Minister of Culture sends his  greetings and is extremely sorry that  owing to prior institutional commitments  he is unable to be present on his behalf  is therefore falls to me to present  before today's distinguish audience the  resolution of the Italian government  which will be submitted to that 196  session of the UNESCO Executive Board a  proposal already approved by the Italian  parliament during last week general  session that has already been welcomed  by director-general Irina Bokova  supported by many countries among which  Spain co-presenter with us France Russia  Morocco Algeria and China for the  creation of a kind of blue helmet  peacekeeping force to defend those  cultural heritage sites that are at risk  in the world Italy also proposes to be  the main point of reference for this  enterprise making available its  internationally recognized expertise in  the rescue and restoration of works of  art I would also like to remind you the  recent proposal that honourable see me  across the chair of the culture and  education committee the european  parliament has put forward regarding  attacks against the cultural heritage  describing them as war crimes against  humanity as well as unesco campaign to  prevent any dealings in antiquities from  iraq and syria and let me underline that  italy strongly supports this proposal  it is only too clear how determined  attraction of the some fanatical groups  capable of controlling vast geographical  areas are and how these actions want to  cancel the cultural identity of the  territory that they occupy at least 28  now I'm afraid there are 29 sides in  Syria Libya and Iraq are already lost  forever and again I underline this world  forever an activity that is blind and  barbaric which causes thousand hundreds  of thousands of victims and has in its  aim also to destroy the cultural  heritage of an occupied population  against this barbarity we have to react  we must define the cultural values  beyond our own borders for if these  torture countries are to have a better  future which we wish for them with all  our being this can only be obtained by  helping them recover their cultural  identity to finish I would like to  extend to everyone present my wish for a  positive and fruitful collaboration  thank you
 

